1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,256
Your phone's GPS

2
00:00:01,256 --> 00:00:02,967
needs EINSTEIN.

3
00:00:03,010 --> 00:00:04,272
Up in space...

4
00:00:04,272 --> 00:00:06,667
time runs FASTER.

5
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:07,838
Gravity slows clocks

6
00:00:07,838 --> 00:00:08,367
down.

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,900
Yours, down here?

8
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:10,933
Dragging.

9
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:11,690
Up there,

10
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:12,798
satellite clocks gain

11
00:00:12,798 --> 00:00:13,656
thirty-eight millionths

12
00:00:13,656 --> 00:00:14,622
of a second...

13
00:00:14,622 --> 00:00:15,700
every day.

14
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:16,720
Sounds tiny?

15
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,282
That's over ten kilometres

16
00:00:18,282 --> 00:00:19,123
of error.

17
00:00:19,123 --> 00:00:20,800
A DAY.

18
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,170
The first test satellite

19
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:24,255
flew with the fix OFF...

20
00:00:24,255 --> 00:00:25,233
in case Einstein

21
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:26,400
was wrong.

22
00:00:26,436 --> 00:00:27,400
He wasn't.

